{"id": "1546436469432787014", "channel_id": "1546436469432787014", "author_id": "513433668887248907", "author_name": "fatedefier_2003", "content": "Its been around 45+ days since I started Morimens. I was able to clear last 2 D-tides at A1 but this time the D-Tide seems to be much more difficult.\nI would really appreciate your help.\nThis is my rooster, please do tell me what teams to use for each zone and what WOD to use for the chars.", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T08:26:25.713000+00:00", "thread_id": "1546436469432787014", "edited_timestamp": "2026-09-07T08:42:12.343000+00:00", "attachments": [{"id": "1546440440285364294", "filename": "image.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 1156570, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1546436469432787014/1546440440285364294/image.png?ex=6a9fca64&is=6a9e78e4&hm=bd8df472e2b0c4c576f7db6d7e9c1d478a6d945253261c1443604f78c1fc2b17&"}, {"id": "1546440448296362044", "filename": "image.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 1166450, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1546436469432787014/1546440448296362044/image.png?ex=6a9fca66&is=6a9e78e6&hm=c815e2a53c228c6db34b5cd5830ca6c7fb597f1211772825490991cde99a2a86&"}, {"id": "1546440448673976320", "filename": "image.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 1053200, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1546436469432787014/1546440448673976320/image.png?ex=6a9fca66&is=6a9e78e6&hm=1c7baf8162fcf1ab5dc14e61a5efb7f02205b54c53ce61d4507479663de9f7c3&"}, {"id": "1546440449177157714", "filename": "image.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 1451665, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1546436469432787014/1546440449177157714/image.png?ex=6a9fca66&is=6a9e78e6&hm=2f2e4f3fdd40c371a60c0ab4271080e04e8741c9ab14512f9bb3a289a1705f35&"}, {"id": "1546440449659773048", "filename": "image.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 1402926, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1546436469432787014/1546440449659773048/image.png?ex=6a9fca66&is=6a9e78e6&h